ter":"。和帝永元五年，诏以广成游猎地假与贫民。灵帝初平元年，置...","context_before":"...周围百里，有灌溉之利，百姓赖之。旧有广成聚。汉置广成苑，","source_end_index":67,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"002c99bb-fc60-555a-a67b-73fe94b46da1","source_start_index":55,"source_text":"东汉时，往往校猎习射于此"}],"path":"河南方舆纪要/九、汝州（卷五十一）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"},{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/〇、封域山川险要（卷五十二）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"此皆新关也。献帝初平二年，董卓胁帝西幸长安，出函谷关。是...","context_before":"...初平二年，校猎上林苑，遂至函谷关。延熹九年，复幸函谷关。","source_end_index":1062,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"2f224efe-0b68-55c9-b219-0c7bdf27567a","source_start_index":1031,"source_text":"灵帝光和五年，校猎上林，历函谷关，遂狩于广成苑[见河南汝州]。"}],"path":"陕西方舆纪要/〇、封域山川险要（卷五十二）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":[],"content":"12帝校獵上林苑，歷函谷關，遂狩于廣成苑。十二月，還，幸太學。","content_fanyi":"灵帝在上林苑打猎，经过函谷关，又到广成苑狩猎。十二月，返回京城洛阳，驾临太学巡视。","content_jianti_auto":"12帝校猎上林苑，历函谷关，遂狩于广成苑。十二月，还，幸太学。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":4989,"number":12,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":11,"tongjian_id":"97a2a2e6-db0e-11ef-8092-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"驄馬，青白雜色。","note_content_jianti_auto":"骢马，青白杂色。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":40,"tongjian_id":"97a2a2eb-db0e-11ef-80e1-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"順帝","people_name_jianti_auto":"顺帝","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"97a2a2ed-db0e-11ef-92bf-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"焉","people_name_jianti_auto":"焉","start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"97a2a2ee-db0e-11ef-aa87-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"焉","people_name_jianti_auto":"焉","start_index":11,"tongjian_id":"97a2a2ef-db0e-11ef