a2a2f3-db0e-11ef-b888-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["人事"],"content":"13桓典爲侍御史，宦官畏之。典常乘驄馬，京師爲之語曰：「行行且止，避驄馬御史！」典，焉之孫也。","content_fanyi":"桓典任侍御史时，宦官都很忌惮他。他经常骑一匹青白杂色的马，京城洛阳便传开这样的话：“行路之人暂且停步，要避开骑青白马的御史！”桓典是桓焉的孙子。","content_jianti_auto":"13桓典为侍御史，宦官畏之。典常乘骢马，京师为之语曰：「行行且止，避骢马御史！」典，焉之孙也。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":4990,"number":13,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":12,"tongjian_id":"97a2a2ea-db0e-11ef-94a8-a0d3651f611f"}],"reign_name":"五年","reign_name_jianti_auto":"五年","start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"97a2a293-db0e-11ef-91d3-a0d3651f611f","year_anno":"（壬戌、一八二）","year_int":182},"message":"success","success":true}